WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.625
<b><font color='#000000'>If you want to edit one of your projects in general, </font></b>

2
00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:06.083
<b><font color='#000000'>you must first select the one you want to modify. </font></b>

3
00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:08.416
<b><font color='#000000'>The selected project becomes highlighted</font></b>

4
00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:11.458
<b><font color='#000000'>and its contents are displayed on the right side. </font></b>

5
00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:16.041
<b><font color='#000000'>Use the "Edit project" button located on the right to start your editing process. </font></b>

6
00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:20.333
<b><font color='#000000'>In this interface you can create different folders to structure your data package</font></b>

7
00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:22.875
<b><font color='#000000'>by using the "Add folder" button.</font></b>

8
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:25.833
<b><font color='#000000'>In the pop-up window that appears after using the button, </font></b>

9
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:28.583
<b><font color='#000000'>you can enter a name for the new folder. </font></b>

10
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:31.250
<b><font color='#000000'>Then click on the Create folder button. </font></b>

11
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.708
<b><font color='#000000'>Now, if you want to put your data in this newly created folder,</font></b>

12
00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:37.875
<b><font color='#000000'>you just have to select it and it will open. </font></b>

13
00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:41.750
<b><font color='#000000'>You can add as many folders as you need.</font></b>

14
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:47.041
<b><font color='#000000'>If you don’t need a folder anymore, you can delete it by using the recycle bin symbol.</font></b>

15
00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:51.166
<b><font color='#000000'>When you click on the symbol, a dialogue box will offer you two options.</font></b>

16
00:00:51.166 --> 00:00:53.750
<b><font color='#000000'>You can either leave the folder unchanged. </font></b>

17
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:57.291
<b><font color='#000000'>Or you can permanently delete the selected folder. </font></b>

18
00:00:57.291 --> 00:00:59.416
<b><font color='#000000'>Please note that if you delete a folder,</font></b>

19
00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:02.875
<b><font color='#000000'> all the data contained in that folder will also be deleted.</font></b>

